   "text": "About **5 years** of driving.\n\n**Why**  \n- Car A: 14,000 mi ÷ 24 mpg ≈ 583 gal → 583 × $3.40 ≈ $1,983 /yr.  \n- Car B: 14,000 mi ÷ 48 mpg ≈ 292 gal → 292 × $3.40 ≈ $992 /yr.  \n- Annual saving ≈ $1,983 – $992 ≈ $991.  \n- Price gap: $27,000 – $22,000 = $5,000.  \n- Pay‑back: $5,000 ÷ $991 ≈ 5.0 years."
